BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 40 750 Td (  Transform list into a heap, in-place, in O\(len\(heap\)\) time.) Tj T* (heappop\(heap, /\)) Tj T* (Pop the smallest item off the heap, maintaining the heap invariant.) Tj T* (heappush\(heap, item, /\)) Tj T* (Push item onto heap, maintaining the heap invariant.) Tj T* (heappushpop\(heap, item, /\)) Tj T* (Push item on the heap, then pop and return the smallest item from the heap.) Tj T* (The combined action runs more efficiently than heappush\(\) followed by) Tj T* (a separate call to heappop\(\).) Tj T* (heapreplace\(heap, item, /\)) Tj T* (Pop and return the current smallest value, and add the new item.) Tj T* (This is more efficient than heappop\(\) followed by heappush\(\), and can be) Tj T* (more appropriate when using a fixed-size heap.  Note that the value) Tj T* (returned may be larger than item!  That constrains reasonable uses of) Tj T* (this routine unless written as part of a conditional replacement:) Tj T* (if item > heap[0]:) Tj T* (item = heapreplace\(heap, item\)) Tj T* (merge\(*iterables, key=None, reverse=False\)) Tj T* (Merge multiple sorted inputs into a single sorted output.) Tj T* (Similar to sorted\(itertools.chain\(*iterables\)\) but returns a generator,) Tj T* (does not pull the data into memory all at once, and assumes that each of) Tj T* (the input streams is already sorted \(smallest to largest\).) Tj T* (>>> list\(merge\([1,3,5,7], [0,2,4,8], [5,10,15,20], [], [25]\)\)) Tj T* ([0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 5, 7, 8, 10, 15, 20, 25]) Tj T* (If *key* is not None, applies a key function to each element to determine) Tj T* (its sort order.) Tj T* (>>> list\(merge\(['dog', 'horse'], ['cat', 'fish', 'kangaroo'], key=len\)\)) Tj T* (['dog', 'cat', 'fish', 'horse', 'kangaroo']) Tj T* (nlargest\(n, iterable, key=None\)) Tj T* (Find the n largest elements in a dataset.) Tj T* (Equivalent to:  sorted\(iterable, key=key, reverse=True\)[:n]) Tj T* (nsmallest\(n, iterable, key=None\)) Tj T* (Find the n smallest elements in a dataset.) Tj T* (Equivalent to:  sorted\(iterable, key=key\)[:n]) Tj T* (DATA) Tj T* (__about) Tj T* ET
